# Pairs with UniqueOwner. A cancel accepted after the map moved closes the
# window without sealing the donor, while the survivor has already reclaimed
# the slot, so a stale router and a fresh one reach different owners.
MODULE: UniqueOwnerFoldCancelAfterCommit
TARGET: UniqueOwner
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a fold is cancelled after its commit, leaving both shards serving the slot
PERTURBS: FoldCancel

--- FIND
    /\ mp \in {"shadow", "swept"}
    /\ mk = "fold"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a cancel accepted at any phase.
    /\ mp \in {"shadow", "swept", "frozen", "flipped"}
    /\ mk = "fold"
--- END
